# Showcase preview labels

In **component preview** rows (size / tone / variant / state labels beside specimens), use:

**`中文 key`**

- **key** must be the exact prop or variant segment used in code (`lg`, `brand`, `solid`, `theme`, `disable`, …).
- Do **not** use English marketing names alone (`Large`, `Medium`, `Theme`, `Brand` without key).
- Do **not** paraphrase keys (`same_white` in CSS vs `sameWhite` in props — show the **prop/API** spelling).

## Examples

| ✅ | ❌ |
|----|-----|
| 大 lg | Large |
| 中 md | Medium |
| 品牌 brand | Brand |
| 主题 theme | Theme |
| 禁用 disable | Disabled |
| 实心 solid | Solid |

Use helpers in `apps/showcase/src/utils/previewLabel.ts` (`previewSizeLabel`, `previewLinkToneLabel`, …) so Button / Link / Input previews stay consistent.

Section **titles** (h2) may stay English (`Size`, `Tone`) unless product asks otherwise; **row labels** next to components follow this rule.
